      "writtenOn": "2026-07-27T22:41:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, yeah, however `ConvolveVerticalPass` requires the template parameters to be compile time constants, so they have to be wrapped and passed and then unwrapped in the lambda.\n\nTo avoid them I can restore to calling `ConvolveVerticalPass` directly but that has a bit more code duplications.\n\nWhich do you think is the better approach?",
      "parentUuid": "6231097e_b140a017",
      "revId": "0f880bd0cc4373e5b8e138455dddbf90017b1c15",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
